{"h":[{"d":[{"f":"茂密，茂盛。","e":["￹`Longalong~ `ko~ `papah~ `no~ to'er.￺￻枷苳樹葉盛茂。"],"r":["`malongalong~"]},{"f":"沒精力，搖搖擺擺。","e":["￹`Longalong~ `saan~ `ko~ `rakat~ `nora~ `malitengay~.￺￻那位老人走路搖榣擺擺的。"]},{"f":"點頭，搖頭。","e":["￹Mi`longalong~ `to~ pi`na'ay~ `kora~ `malitengay~.￺￻那位老人摇頭拒絕。"]}]}],"t":"longalong"}